  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "CUBEMEMBERPROPERTY returns #N/A for every property on a workbook data model member after validating scalar argument errors",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527, CUBEMEMBERPROPERTY(connection, member_expression, property) checks scalar errors in connection, member_expression, and property in argument order (returning the first error), and returns #N/A for every tried property (MEMBER_CAPTION, MEMBER_UNIQUE_NAME, MEMBER_NAME, MEMBER_KEY, column name, or unknown property) on a workbook data model member or measure. All 4,279 full-bank CUBEMEMBERPROPERTY rows match.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured in DnaCalc crates/calc-host/tests/fixtures/pivot_cube/oracle.xlsx (rows A94, A112-A119, Excel 16.0.20527) and CalcFunc-Evidence admit2-answers-cubememberproperty-special.json; 4,279/4,279 full-bank rows match.",
